              <div class="para">
                <p>
                  Our team of trained and qualified educators employs the VARK
                  teaching methodology, embracing a multisensory approach to
                  learning. This allows us to tailor the educational experience
                  to meet the unique learning styles of each student, ensuring
                  that every child thrives in the classroom.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="life-at-list">
              <div>
                <h3>Comprehensive Extensive Resources</h3>
                <h6 class="subititle">More than 3,600 Library Books</h6>
              </div>

              <div class="para">
                <p>
                  We offer a well-stocked library that serves as an invaluable
                  resource, enhancing our curriculum with a wide range of
